      "en": "Build Blend and Digraph Words"
    },
    "page_intro": {
      "en": "Build words that begin with two letters working together — blends like fr and st (two sounds blended) and digraphs like sh and ch (two letters, one sound). Tap the sound chunks in order to spell the word for the picture, and tap Hear it to listen. Take your time; there is no timer and no score. Aligned to Common Core RF.1.3 — knowing the spelling-sound correspondences for common consonant digraphs and blends."
    },
